{
  "id": "21892_mikaeru",
  "headword": "{見返|みかえ}る",
  "reading": "みかえる",
  "romaji": "mikaeru",
  "part_of_speech": "verb (godan)",
  "gloss": "to look back; to turn around and look",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to look back; to turn around and look",
      "explanation": "To turn one's head or body to look at something behind or beside oneself."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "21892_mikaeru_ex1",
      "japanese": "⟦{声|こえ}→声：02207_koe⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧かけられて{見返|みかえ}った。",
      "english": "Someone called out to me, and I turned around to look.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": true,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "21892_mikaeru_ex2",
      "japanese": "⟦{彼女|かのじょ}→彼女：01286_kanojo⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧ちらっ⟦と→と：00512_to⟧{見返|みかえ}って⟦{微笑|ほほえ}んだ→微笑む：02416_hohoemu⟧。",
      "english": "She glanced back and smiled.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": true,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "21892_mikaeru_ex3",
      "japanese": "⟦{振|ふ}り{返|かえ}って→振り返る：04231_furikaeru⟧{見返|みかえ}る⟦と→と：00512_to⟧、⟦{誰|だれ}も→誰も：18610_daremo⟧⟦いなかった→いる：00495_iru⟧。",
      "english": "When I turned around to look, no one was there.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": true,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "A godan verb ({見返|みかえ}った, {見返|みかえ}って, {見返|みかえ}らない).\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{振|ふ}り{返|かえ}る→振り返る：04231_furikaeru⟧: to turn around; to look back — more common for this physical meaning\n- ⟦{振|ふ}り{向|む}く→振り向く：04232_furimuku⟧: to turn to face someone — implies facing toward\n\nWATCH OUT:\n⟦{見返|みかえ}す→見返す：14217_mikaesu⟧ (transitive) is a different verb: to look at again, to look back at someone, and to prove one's critics wrong (⟦{見返|みかえ}して→見返す：14217_mikaesu⟧⟦やる→やる：02980_yaru⟧, I'll show them). Do not use {見返|みかえ}る for that meaning.",
